      "role": "user",
      "content": "<conversation_history>\nuser: Make an eight zero eight base.\nuser: Set oscillator 1 to a sine wave (wavetable position 0 on basic shapes) and transpose down 1 octave (-12 semitones) for the deep sub foundation. Set envelope 1 to instant attack (0s), zero sustain (0%), and a long decay around 2-3 seconds for the classic 808 tail that fades out smoothly.\nassistant: Done.\nuser: Add a pitch envelope by routing envelope 2 to oscillator 1 pitch with a very short decay (0.05s) and moderate amount \u2014 this creates the characteristic 'punch' transient at the start of the hit. Add subtle saturation/soft distortion at low drive (15-25%) to give the sine wave some harmonic presence and help it translate on smaller speakers.\nassistant: Done.\nuser: Make a dreamy keyboard sound.\nuser: Enable oscillator 2 with a soft sawtooth wave, transpose up 12 semitones (one octave above osc 1), and set level around 0.4 for a brighter harmonic layer. Add 2-3 unison voices with subtle detune (around 2.5) on both oscillators for gentle thickness.\nassistant: Done.\nuser: Enable filter 1 as a low-pass with cutoff around 70-75 and low resonance (0.15-0.2). Route envelope 3 to filter cutoff with moderate amount (40-50%) using a slow attack (0.3s), moderate decay (0.8s), high sustain (75%), and medium release (0.7s) for that soft, dreamy envelope.\nassistant: Done.\nuser: Adjust envelope 1 (amplitude) to slow attack (0.2-0.3s), full sustain, and longer release (1.2-1.5s) so notes swell in gently and fade out smoothly.\nassistant: Done.\nuser: Enable chorus at 35-40% wet mix for stereo width and shimmer. Add reverb with a medium-large size (0.6-0.7), longer decay, and around 35-40% wet mix for spacious atmosphere.\nassistant: Done.\nuser: You can ask, what did you just do?\nassistant: I enabled chorus and reverb with spacious settings to add stereo width, shimmer, and atmosphere to the dreamy keyboard sound. Chorus is at ~38% wet with 4 voices, and reverb has a larger size (0.65), longer decay (~2.8 seconds), and ~38% wet mix for that lush, spacious character.\nuser: Make it dreamier.\nassistant: Done.\nuser: Add a snare drum also in the back, but something like synth wave like.\nuser: Enable oscillator 3 with noise (white noise wavetable or sampler) mixed with a triangle wave tuned down an octave for the snare body. Set the triangle level lower (~0.3) than the noise (~0.6) for that synth-wave character.\nassistant: Done.\n</conversation_history>\n\n<current_preset>\n{\"author\":\"\",\"comments\":\"\",\"macro1\":\"MACRO 1\",\"macro2\":\"MACRO 2\",\"macro3\":\"MACRO 3\",\"macro4\":\"MACRO 4\",\"preset_name\":\"\",\"preset_style\":\"\",\"settings\":{\"beats_per_minute\":2.0,\"bypass\":0.0,\"chorus_cutoff\":60.0,\"chorus_delay_1\":-9.0,\"chorus_delay_2\":-7.0,\"chorus_dry_wet\":0.44999998807907104,\"chorus_feedback\":0.4000000059604645,\"chorus_frequency\":-3.0,\"chorus_mod_depth\":0.550000011920929,\"chorus_on\":1.0,\"chorus_spread\":1.0,\"chorus_sync\":1.0,\"chorus_tempo\":4.0,\"chorus_voices\":4.0,\"compressor_attack\":0.5,\"compressor_band_gain\":11.699999809265137,\"compressor_band_lower_ratio\":0.800000011920929,\"compressor_band_lower_threshold\":-36.0,\"compressor_band_upper_ratio\":0.8569999933242798,\"compressor_band_upper_threshold\":-25.0,\"compressor_enabled_bands\":0.0,\"compressor_high_gain\":16.299999237060547,\"compressor_high_lower_ratio\":0.800000011920929,\"compressor_high_lower_threshold\":-35.0,\"compressor_high_upper_ratio\":1.0,\"compressor_high_upper_threshold\":-30.0,\"compressor_low_gain\":16.299999237060547,\"compressor_low_lower_ratio\":0.800000011920929,\"compressor_low_lower_threshold\":-35.0,\"compressor_low_upper_ratio\":0.8999999761581421,\"compressor_low_upper_threshold\":-28.0,\"compressor_mix\":1.0,\"compressor_on\":0.0,\"compressor_release\":0.5,\"delay_aux_frequency\":2.0,\"delay_aux_sync\":1.0,\"delay_aux_tempo\":9.0,\"delay_dry_wet\":0.33340001106262207,\"delay_feedback\":0.5,\"delay_filter_cutoff\