h cutoff around 40-50 to remove low-end mud from the snare and let the crack cut through. Route the sampler through this filter.\n\n4. Increase distortion drive to around 15-20 to add more aggression and help the transient bite harder. This will give the snare more presence and punch.\n</current_request>"
