off around 40-50 to remove low-end mud from the snare and let the crack cut through. Route the sampler through this filter. Increase distortion drive to around 15-20 to add more aggression and help the transient bite harder.\nassistant: Done.\n</conversation_history>\n\n<current_request>\nSAVE THIS NOW\n</current_request>"
